# package.json / package-lock.json were ignored here until 17.08.2026. They are
# part of the package now: the browser half of the floor resolves `playwright`
# from the project, and a fresh install with no manifest has nothing to
# `npm install` — so every browser probe reported an honest skip that read like
# a pass (D-BZ-2, case №1).
